 answer is 3. \"abc\" has no repeats and nothing longer works.","say":"For example, with s equals \"abcabcbb\", the answer is 3. \"abc\" has no repeats and nothing longer works.","card":{"lines":["Input: s = \"abcabcbb\"","Output: 3","\"abc\" has no repeats and nothing longer works."]}},{"k":"idea","cap":"Instead of shrinking one step at a time, remember the last index where each character was seen. When s[right] was seen inside the window, jump left just past that earlier copy in one move.","say":"Instead of shrinking one step at a time, remember the last index where each character was seen. When s at right was seen inside the window, jump left just past that earlier copy in one move.","card":{"pattern":"sliding-window","name":"Sliding Window"}},{"k":"trace","cap":"Let's walk through it with s = \"abcabcbb\".","say":"Let's walk through it with s equals \"abcabcbb\".","st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"1"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'a' has length 1. Best: 1.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":0}],"w":[0,0]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"1"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'ab' has length 2. Best: 2.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":1}],"w":[0,1]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"2"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"}]}]}},{"k":"step","cap":"The window 'abc' has length 3. Best: 3.","ln":{"python":7,"java":9},"st":{"arrays":[{"n":"s","v":["a","b","c","a","b","c","b","b"],"p":[{"l":"left","i":0},{"l":"right","i":2}],"w":[0,2]}],"vars":[{"k":"best","v":"3"}],"maps":[{"n":"last seen","e":[{"k":"a","v":"0"},{"k":"b","v":"1"},{"k":"c","v":"2"}]